リス…ドＳな二人をお願い出来たら嬉しいです！\n鹿角様のタッチで大好きなキャラとリアルでカッコイイ兵器…本当に大好きで…またもや贅沢でワガママなシチュで本当に申し訳ございません。\n本当に鹿角様のご迷惑で無ければで大丈夫ですので、\nお時間がございます時、\nお気が向きましたらで構いませんので、いつまでも待ちますので、\n宜しければ、どうか宜しくお願い致します。\nお題箱に相変わらず長文で下手な説明で本当に申し訳ございません。", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 23260, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ぱとら（本物）", "screen_name": "Patrasche_1599", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F2073ea99-7028-4ad9-a385-4c0642b07a1b.gif&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/a53dc3e7-867c-43f5-b898-3dd0973ed604.png", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 1184813, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "樋口いとの✿Skeb募集中✿", "screen_name": "itono_higuti", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2014274513534394368/L_fFDlJT.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4042634600/1769075410/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "video"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 1706029, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Suzu 7.29 skeb募集中", "screen_name": "Suzu245612", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1992125417084588032/shegsI9j.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.c